{"id":"489532","name":"佛手瓜栗子胡萝卜瘦肉汤","author":"elmonte","authorId":"266491","desc":"","cover":"images/489532/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"佛手瓜","amount":"3个"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"2根"},{"name":"栗子","amount":"200g"},{"name":"无花果","amount":"6-7个"},{"name":"瘦肉","amount":"500g"}],"sub":[{"name":"南杏","amount":"5g"},{"name":"北杏","amount":"5g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"佛手瓜洗净，对半切开，去籽，切小块。","img":"images/489532/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"胡萝卜去皮到块。","img":"images/489532/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"南北杏洗净。","img":"images/489532/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"无花果对半切开，以便出味。","img":"images/489532/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"瘦肉飞水。","img":"images/489532/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"栗子洗净。(我用的是冷冻去皮栗子。)","img":"images/489532/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"把所有材料放入电压力锅，按煲汤键开煮。","img":"images/489532/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"煲好了。","img":"images/489532/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"无需放盐，此汤非常清甜。","img":"images/489532/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"清润下火，强身健体。","img":"images/489532/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电压力锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}